      `/Users/polarzero/.codex/plugins/cache/openai-primary-runtime/spreadsheets/26.723.12215/skills
      `\n### Available skills\n- imagegen: Generate or edit raster images when the task benefits
      from AI-created bitmap visuals such as photos, illustrations, textures, sprites, mockups
      (file: r2/imagegen/SKILL.md)\n- openai-docs: Use when the user asks how to build with OpenAI
      products or APIs, asks about Codex itself or choosing Codex surfaces, needs up-to-date
      official (file: r2/openai-docs/SKILL.md)\n- plugin-creator: Create and scaffold plugin
      directories for Codex with a required `.codex-plugin/plugin.json`, optional plugin
      folders/files, valid manifest de (file: r2/plugin-creator/SKILL.md)\n- skill-creator: Guide
      for creating effective skills. This skill should be used when users want to create a new skill
      (or update an existing skill) that extends (file: r2/skill-creator/SKILL.md)\n-
      skill-installer: Install Codex skills into $CODEX_HOME/skills from a curated list or a GitHub
      repo path. Use when a user asks to list installable skills, install (file:
      r2/skill-installer/SKILL.md)\n- browser:control-in-app-browser: Control the in-app Browser for
      opening, navigating, inspecting visible or interactive page state, clicking, typing,
      screenshots, and local web (file:
      r3/browser/26.721.41059/skills/control-in-app-browser/SKILL.md)\n- documents:documents:
      Create, edit, redline, and comment on `.docx`, Word, and Google Docs-targeted document
      artifacts inside the container, with a strict render-and- (file:
      r5/documents/26.723.12215/skills/documents/SKILL.md)\n- pdf:pdf: Read, create, inspect,
