      help\nEXIT 0\nMSW — grouped MicroSandbox development workspaces\n\nEnter / edit\n msw dev
      [PATH] Ghostty/SSH shell in dev\n msw playgrounds [PATH] Shell in playgrounds\n msw personal
      [PATH] Shell in personal\n msw zed WORKSPACE [PATH] Open workspace/repository in Zed\n msw
      exec WORKSPACE COMMAND... Run a command in /workspace\n\nRepositories\n msw clone WORKSPACE
      OWNER/REPO [PATH] Clone, including into nested folders\n msw repos WORKSPACE List
      repositories\n msw pull WORKSPACE [PATH|all] Fast-forward-only pull\n msw push WORKSPACE PATH
      [--yes] Explicit host-only push\n msw push ... --force-with-lease Exact lease-protected force
      push\n msw identity \"NAME\" EMAIL [TARGET] Set commit identity\n\nGitHub permissions\n msw
      github setup WORKSPACE OWNER/REPO [--read-only]\n Store tokens and run the permission test\n
      msw github verify WORKSPACE [REPO] Rerun the configured permission test\n msw github status
      [WORKSPACE|all] Show credential presence\n msw github remove WORKSPACE Remove that workspace's
      tokens\n\nWebsites\n msw open WORKSPACE [PORT] [SCHEME] Start VM and open published URL\n msw
      url WORKSPACE [PORT] [SCHEME] Print URL\n msw ports [WORKSPACE|all] List pre-published ports\n
      msw tunnel WORKSPACE REMOTE [LOCAL] Temporary tunnel for an unlisted port\n\nLifecycle /
      maintenance\n msw start|stop|restart [TARGET] TARGET is a workspace or all\n msw status VM
      status and URLs\n msw metrics [TARGET] Live metrics\n msw logs WORKSPACE [MSB OPTIONS] Sandbox
      logs\n msw disk [TARGET] Filesystem and Docker usage\n msw resize WORKSPACE MEMORY [CPUS]
      Resize within configured limits\n msw clean [TARGET] [--volumes] Prune Docker; volumes require
      explicit opt-in\n msw upgrade [TARGET] Upgrade guest Ubuntu packages\n msw update Update
      MicroSandbox\n msw check [--deep] Configuration or full end-to-end check\n msw host repair
      Recreate local names, loopbacks, and SSH setup\n\nBackup / reference\n msw backup [DIRECTORY]
      Cold sparse zstd backup; restarts prior VMs\n msw restore ARCHIVE Transactional restore;
      leaves VMs stopped\n msw docs [cheatsheet|setup|github|tests]\n msw version\n msw
      help\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"COMMAND MSW_CONFIG_FILE=\"$PWD/config.sh\" bin/msw
